  "confirmation": "This is a firm, non-negotiable policy. Basic economy flights are not eligible for any modifications, including upgrades to economy or business class. This rule applies universally and has no exceptions, regardless of membership level (regular, silver, or gold), flight date, or proximity to departure. No exceptions, waivers, or special cases are available for such upgrades. This policy is enforced by the airline and cannot be overridden."
}

